tessdata_fast language data (eng, jpn, kor, chi_sim, chi_tra, rus, deu, fra,
spa, por, ita, pol, tur, vie, tha, ara)
    Licence: Apache-2.0
    https://github.com/tesseract-ocr/tessdata_fast
